    <name>Endurance 90 L06B - Z2 4x15 @ 74%</name>
    <description>Endurance 90 minutes - level 6 of 10, variant B. Z2 4x15 @ 74%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 15 min @ 74%, 5 min @ 60%, 15 min @ 74%, 5 min @ 60%, 15 min @ 74%, 5 min @ 60%, 15 min @ 74%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Four blocks near the top of Zone 2 with short easy breaks. Eat 40-60 g of carbohydrate per hour on rides this long.

Estimated TSS: 71.</description>
